    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        20,
        780
      ],
      "size": [
        360,
        900
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "title": "How to use",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Anima Turbo + Character Ref + 3D pose (simple)\n\nColumns from left to right: models → model patches → pose → character → prompt → sampling → output.\n\n**Pose**: load a shaded 3D body mesh rendered on **black** (Pose Studio, Blender, Daz, any 3D posing app,\nor the [sample](https://huggingface.co/toyxyz/Anima_ControlNet-LLLite/blob/main/example_workflow/3dpose_example.png)).\nOpenPose skeletons, depth maps or lineart do not work with this control model.\nThe output size follows the pose image (~1 MP).\n\n**LoRAs**: add your own Anima LoRAs in *LoRAs (Anima)* (empty by default).\n\n**No pose**: select *LLLite 3D pose* and bypass it (Ctrl+B).\n\n**Prompt**: scene and pose tags only; the reference gives the character. Use `1girl` / `1boy`.\n\n**Defaults**: 8 steps euler/simple, CFG 1, REF guidance 1, Safe PAG 1.3. LLLite strength 1, 0 → 1;\nend it earlier (0.6-0.8) if the pose is too rigid.\n\n## Downloads (folders under `ComfyUI/models/`)\n\n- **diffusion_models/** [anima-turbo-v1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/blob/main/split_files/diffusion_models/anima-turbo-v1.0.safetensors)\n  (this workflow loads a local INT8 conversion; pick the file you have)\n- **text_encoders/** [qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/blob/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors)\n- **vae/** [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/blob/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n- **loras/** [anima_ref_adapter_v2_r64.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ElectronGirl/anima-ref-adapter/blob/main/anima_ref_adapter_v2_r64.safetensors)\n- **model_patches/** [anima_3dpose_6200.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/toyxyz/Anima_ControlNet-LLLite/blob/main/anima_3dpose_6200.safetensors)\n\n## Custom nodes\n\n- [ComfyUI-Anima-Ref-Adapter](https://github.com/ElectronGirl/ComfyUI-Anima-Ref-Adapter)\n- [ComfyUI-Anima-CharRef-LLLite](https://github.com/quinteroac/ComfyUI-Anima-CharRef-LLLite)\n- [comfyui-anima-safe-pag](https://github.com/iljung1106/comfyui-anima-safe-pag)\n- [comfyui-anima-style-nodes](https://github.com/fulletLab/comfyui-anima-style-nodes)\n- [rgthree-comfy](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy) (Power Lora Loader)\n\nThe LLLite model was trained on Anima Base; with Turbo it is experimental."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
